---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Submit a Case" description="How to submit a documented case of Flock Safety ALPR camera abuse for review.">
  <article class="submit-page">
    <p><a href="/database/">← Back to database</a></p>
    <h1>Submit a Case</h1>
    <p>
      Every case in the database requires at least one working source URL
      from a court filing, government record, public audit log, or reporting
      from a named outlet. Submissions without one are not published. See the{" "}
      <a href="/methodology">methodology page</a> for the full criteria.
    </p>

    <h2>Option 1: GitHub pull request (fastest)</h2>
    <p>
      If you're comfortable with GitHub, add a JSON file to{" "}
      <code>data/abuse-cases/</code> in our repository matching the schema in{" "}
      <code>data/schemas/abuse-case.schema.json</code>, then open a pull
      request. Automated checks will verify the file's shape and that it has
      at least one <code>https://</code> source before a maintainer reviews
      it.
    </p>

    <h2>Option 2: Web form</h2>
    <p>
      A web form for non-technical submitters is coming soon. In the
      meantime, please use the GitHub pull request option above, or reach
      out via the <a href="/join">contact/join page</a> once it's live.
    </p>

    <p>
      All submissions, however they arrive, are verified against their
      sources before publication.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .submit-page {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .submit-page code {
    background: rgba(232, 232, 232, 0.1);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
</style>
